Package: czd-wallpapers
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, czd-purple-tokens (= ${binary:Version})
Description: CZD Purple wallpapers (default, event, sponsors, lock)
 Four 1920x1080 plates sharing one trace-field component: wallpaper-default,
 wallpaper-event, wallpaper-sponsors and wallpaper-lock, plus the flattened
 boot plates. Registered as a Plasma wallpaper package.
